*.xccheckout
DerivedData/
build/
*.moved-aside
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

# NOTE: CusanaWatch.xcodeproj IS committed on purpose — it is generated by
# XcodeGen (`xcodegen generate`) but the client's next developer should be able
# to clone and hit Run without installing extra tooling.

